  "description": "If you are looking for a capable, highly durable eMTB built to last, the Antero is ready to lead the way. Designed for control, confidence, and all-road adventure, the Antero features full front suspension and a center mono shock to help keep the wheels planted and the rider in command across trails, dirt, and open pavement.\nIts torque-driven performance pairs with CST Patrol 26 x 3.0 tires to deliver power where it matters, while maintaining a lower center of gravity for confident handling when the ride transitions from trail to blacktop. A high-capacity 48V 20Ah Li NMC battery keeps you moving longer, and Tektro brakes provide dependable stopping power when you need it.\nWith a comfortable saddle, efficient pedaling, five levels of pedal assist, aircraft-grade aluminum construction, stainless fasteners, and water-resistant connectors throughout, the Antero delivers a rugged, reliable riding experience built for all roads, all weather, and riders who want to get there first.",
